# demo_net_udp_sender_ping_pong Specification

## Overview

`demo_net_udp_sender_ping_pong` demonstrates UDP ping-pong messaging (sender side) using asimov_net.

## Usage

```bash
python demo_net_udp_sender_ping_pong.py [options]
```

## Arguments

| Argument | Type | Default | Description |
|----------|------|---------|-------------|
| `--host` | str | "127.0.0.1" | Target host |
| `--port` | int | 5000 | Target port |

## Features

- UDP ping-pong sender
- Connectionless networking demo

## Exit

- Script exits automatically
